</span></td>
<td id="A5.T6.2.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
<span id="A5.T6.2.16.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.8pt;">
<span id="A5.T6.2.16.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Entity Recognition &amp; Extraction</span>
</span></td>
