<span id="A5.T6.2.16.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A5.T6.2.16.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Identifies specific entities (people, organizations, terms) in text. Organizes and categorizes information from unstructured content.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T6.2.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T6.2.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
<span id="A5.T6.2.17.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:28.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T6.2.17.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.T6.2.17.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">C.12</span></span>
</span></td>
