<span id="A5.T6.2.17.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="A5.T6.2.17.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Checks consistency between summaries and source content. Verifies whether claims align with provided information.</span>
</span></td></tr>
